","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"never pushes it more than ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxWait"},{"text":" past the oldest pending drain, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"steady stream of edits still reaches storage. When the timer fires, flushes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"all pending writes in a single ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Task"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A flush whose save fails is retried on a doubling backoff, bounded by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy","isActive":true},{"text":". Without that a failed save is silent data loss: the buffers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are cleared at flush time, so the write would only ever reach storage if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"user happened to touch the same entity again. Running out of attempts is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reported through the writer rather than passing in silence, and the batch","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stays pending so a later edit or an explicit ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistencePlugin\/flush()","isActive":true},{"text":" tries once more.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Wiring","type":"heading","anchor":"Wiring","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let persistence = PersistencePlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","    writers: [","        StateWriter(keyPath: \\.decks) { writes, deletes in ... },","        StateWriter(keyPath: \\.cards) { writes, deletes in ... },","    ],","    debounce: .milliseconds(250)",")","plugins.register(persistence)"]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistencePlugin"},"variants":[{"traits